<title>USA: Excelsior-Henderson signs up 12 dealers.</title>
<headline>Excelsior-Henderson signs up 12 dealers.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Excelsior-Henderson Motorcycle Manufacturing Co said Thursday it has signed on an initial 12 dealers to sell and service the company's heavyweight cruiser motorcycles, as well as sell related merchandise and clothing.</p>
<p>Excelsior-Henderson, a development stage company, plans to manufacture, market and sell premium American heavyweight cruiser and touring motorcycles. The company's 160,000 square foot manufacturing and administrative facility in Belle Plaine, Minn., is currently under construction.</p>
<p>The dealers are located in Minnesota, Illinois, Indiana, California, Michigan, Colorado, Wisconsin, and North Carolina.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
